<title>CHINA: China Jan-Aug tin exports slip 17.5 pct yr-on-yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Aug tin exports slip 17.5 pct yr-on-yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's exports of unwrought tin and tin alloys fell to 20,523 tonnes in the first eight months, down 17.5 percent compared with the year-ago period, customs figures showed on Monday.</p>
<p>Tin exports were 4,295 tonnes in August.</p>
</text>
